# .ccscignore — answer texts the conversation browser leaves out
#
# The browser shows each prompt's final answer: the turn's last substantial
# text in Claude's own voice. A text that matches a rule here is dropped
# first, so it can never become the answer: useful for housekeeping replies
# such as a /loop's.
#
# The mod ships this text as .ccscignore.def and copies it to .ccscignore on
# first use. Edit .ccscignore: an update of the mod replaces only
# .ccscignore.def.

# plain lines = exact match (trimmed)
Awaken skipped.

# /…/ = regular expression
/^Commandments loaded\./
